   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "なくても いい form",
     "texto": [
      "To say **it's not necessary**, take the **ない** form of the verb, drop the **い** and add **なくても いい です**: **いか** + **なくても いい** → **いかなくても いい です** (there's no need to go).",
      "With **する** it becomes **しなくても いい**, and with **たべる** it becomes **たべなくても いい**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Be careful",
     "texto": [
      "**なくても いい** isn't a prohibition: it only says that it isn't necessary. If you want to prohibit something, use **〜てはいけません** (chapter 11)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
